ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-03T19:21:49-07:00","id":1385512,"title":"","content":"Cool cool, I've got some notes on things and once I'm done with dinner I'm gonna do some brainstorming and roll up something in here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-03T20:43:37-07:00","id":1385528,"title":"","content":"Anatole is a moderator for the new vampire internet community, bloodreddit, and spends a lot of time moderating the fan clubs for famous vampires.<br /> <br /> Bell and Lucita chat a lot about what it is like to try to herd insane cats.<br /> <br /> Beckett has dropped off the radar following the events of BJD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-03T22:00:57-07:00","id":1385536,"title":"","content":"Following their emancipation from the influence of the embryonic Dracon, Sascha Vykos is now one of the leading beauty and lifestyle influencers on Youtube.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-03T22:27:57-07:00","id":1385540,"title":"","content":"The West Coast of the United States is a political sinkhole for vampires. Many Anarchs have refused to leave, the Camarilla struggled to maintain its footholds, Asian kindred develop outposts, and the sabbat terrorizes from below. But that aside, let's look at a few noteworthy individuals...<br /> <br /> \u2022Robin Leeland<br /> -Sometimes rumored to be a factor in the rise of the 'Robin Hood' legends, Leeland is known as one of the Anarch heroes of Europe. The Old World is held like a vice by the sects, yet this Brujah continues to make himself known through domain undermining and supporting societal change amongst the lower classes. He's also gained a somewhat bizarre reputation for being the bane of the Church of England and his calling card of Marianist (as in the Virgin Mary) iconography. Apparently that was something of a bold stance in his day.<br /> <br /> \u2022Marguerite Foccart<br /> -Robin's french childe, this woman is well known amongst the Anarchs of the upper West Coast. From Portland and around the states, she's known to be an ideological leader. Which has been useful with the betrayals of Tara and Garcia and MacNeil's refusal to provide leadership.<br /> <br /> \u2022Crispus Attucks <br /> -The fall of the Free States during the West Coast Wars embittered the old war hero. Regardless of the current politics of the west coast, Crispus has fallen in with the roving Anarch Movement crossing America. He was recently noted for his participation within the BlackLivesMatter movement and as a continued advocate for racial equality amongst both mortal and immortal societies. Crispus is rather dedicated to his stances placing those who wish to argue with him in somewhat dangerous positions.<br /> <br /> \u2022Smiling Jack<br /> -Black Jack, Bloody Jack, Calico Jack; call him what you like this old pirate still has it. All across the Americas his scattered children cause chaos and disrupt the sects and reports of his appearances and sabotage of Camarilla and Sabbat practices flare up constantly. Still a hero of many Anarchs, particularly young radicals, his name is steadily growing towards Red List potential... if the Inner Circle is willing to whip the Movement into a lather of that degree.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-03T22:56:30-07:00","id":1385545,"title":"","content":"+ <b>Marcus Vitel</b> is currently the Emperor of Washington D.C and one of the leading Anarchs in America now. This is despite the fact that he is overtly an autocrat and makes no pretenses to freedom or democracy. Ironically, this has done little to affect his popularity as he also makes direct offers of domain and wealth that far exceed many Anarchs' wildest dreams. Marcus Vitel has used the American Dream as a weapon and many vampires have voluntarily signed up to serve as his armies. The threat of the Second Inquisition has people believe in a king as long as the rules are upfront and he's strong. Many lesser Anarch Barons (called &quot;Governors&quot;) have sworn allegiance to to him for monthly checks in the six figures as well as weapons.<br /> <br /> Vitel is completely plugged into the Second Inquisition and actively uses it. The reason the NSA's Felicity Price broke her Dominate is because Vitel was her Regent and ordered her too. He is also behind the breach at Schrek.net and other attacks. He is fully of the mind he can control it and use it to purge the world of his rivals as well as potentially the Antediluvians. He wishes to control the American nuclear arsenal or at least enough of it to wipe out the Eldest. He is still insane but has switched from nuclear brinkmanship to the War on Terror.<br /> <br /> + <b>Ur-Shulgi</b> is dead or at least people assume he's dead. The Camarilla made use of the American War on Terror to drop a MOAB on Alamut under the lie that it was a deeply embedded terrorist bade. This destroyed about 80% of the Web of Knives as well as countless torprous Elders. The Banu Haqim are split on this action but most believe it was justified. Others believe they have undoubtedly PISSED Ur-Shulgi off and some believe the Beckoning is because dropping the bomb may have stirred Haqim to awakening. For now, the Assamite Second Eldest is buried under a mountain of rubble. Crippled but alive.<br /> <br /> + <b>Augustus Giovanni</b> is imprisoned in Saint Peter's coffin by Japeth underneath the Vatican with the True Faith of a billion Catholics and the bones inside. He is unable to exert his disciplines and utterly helpless as he burns. Japeth predicts it will take approximately a thousand years for his soul to completely burn away at this rate. It is a pittance of time to bring the Final Death to an Antediluvian--even the weakest and lowliest of them all.<br /> <br /> + <b>Cappadocius</b> currently rules over the Far Shore Realm that most closely resembles the traditional Christian depiction of Hell. It is a vast inferno of flames, torture, and horror that mostly is full of Specters and vampire spirits that he has made his demons. He rules over them in the guise of the <b>Grim Reaper</b> and believes he has diablerized the Devil even if he has not diablerized God. If Augustus Giovanni had succeeded in his plan to merge the Physical World and Underworld then he would have invaded with his own people. He is responsible for many Risen in the world and you can become one by making a pact with him.<br /> <br /> + <b>Sullivan Dane</b> is now 62 years old, still in excellent shape for his age, and responsible for the deaths of over a hundred Kindred including a dozen Elders. He has lung cancer from a lifetime of smoking and actually survived his suicidal attack on a Chicago Elysium. He is currently of the mind most vampires are unworthy of death and this has put him on &quot;sabbatical&quot; from the Inquisition. Part of the issue with his death seeking is that he has recently gained the ability to see things that should not be seen and coincidences conspire to save his life. He is either Awakening, Imbued, or genuinely protected by God.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 05-04-2020, 08:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T16:28:48-07:00","id":1385674,"title":"","content":"Eyyyy Sullivan Dane! Glad to see that everyone's fan favorite hunter is still kicking it! X D<br /> <br /> I'm gonna open up my notes and get some more stuff but I definitely am a fan of everyone's favorite human badass and Marcus &quot;Sure, I'm technically an Anarch, why not?&quot; Vitel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T22:39:42-07:00","id":1385749,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryffon15</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1385674#post1385674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eyyyy Sullivan Dane! Glad to see that everyone's fan favorite hunter is still kicking it! X D</div> </div> </div> </div>I like the idea he's either going to become something supernatural or die in the blaze of glory because he can't handle that,<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I'm gonna open up my notes and get some more stuff but I definitely am a fan of everyone's favorite human badass and Marcus &quot;Sure, I'm technically an Anarch, why not?&quot; Vitel. </div> </div> </div>At the end of the day, Marcus needed an army and doesn't see much difference between the Anarchs and the Camarilla's lower classes. Caesar knew how to motivate the mob and so does Marcus. Mind you, he predates the Camarilla enough to still think of it as a new organization in my view.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T22:49:53-07:00","id":1385750,"title":"","content":"+ <b>Anatole</b> has become a web ministry sensation that has become the religious equivalent of Banksy for the fact that his sermons that talk about Gehenna, vampires, Antediluvians, and more have spread across the internet despite countless attempts to take them down. So much so that many think he should be on the Red List alongside Theo Bell. He actually has a much larger ministry of human followers than vampire ones. Anatole is believed by many to also be dead but his spirit lives in the Malkavian Madness Network among dozens of hackers as well as street preachers. He wants to redeem Lucita but whether such a thing is wanted by her or possible is anyone's guess.<br /> <br /> + The <b>Wan Kuei</b> were forced to withdraw from large portions of their territory due to the Yama Kings swallowing up hundreds, if not thousands of them, into the hells. They were aided by this from a heretofore large number of Cainites that had been living in secret in their territories but have since allied with the Camarilla. The Wan Kuei still exist but as a minority in their own lands.<br /> <br /> + <b>Salvador Garcia</b> betrayed the Anarch cause for the Jade Courts because his commitment to utopian communism was actually greater than his commitment to Anarch freedom. Salvador had been an ally of the Brujah Council as well as its authoritarian rule well before he was an ally of Jeremy MacNeil. He has since murdered most of his former colleagues in the Kuei-Jin and New Promise Mandarite, claiming that his treason was slander. Theo Bell has evidence of his crimes and is blackmailing him into hiding him. Salvador has since started receiving help from the Russian Federation, though, and has begun once more undermining the Princedoms from the inside.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-05T07:02:13-07:00","id":1385812,"title":"","content":"<b>Beckett </b>is still kicking around, researching and writing. He would never call himself a &quot;Gehenna prophet&quot;- how unspeakably gauche- but he believes it's real, now. It's real, it's happened before, and maybe it can actually be stopped. The Inner Council is debating putting him on the Red List still. <br /> <br /> <b>Victoria Ash</b> is sitting in the Tehran haven she shares with Tegyrius, and she's bored out of her skull. She sympathizes with Iranian mortals who push for a more liberal culture, because currently what passes for a party in Tehran is horribly dull. She knows too much is at stake to start cheating on Tegyrius with somebody, but <i>God</i> if the thought isn't tempting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-05T23:18:25-07:00","id":1386014,"title":"","content":"Up from the Warrens; the subterranean world and one filled with tunnels, catacombs, sewers, and subways alongside whatever else whether natural or artificial that the sewer rats can claim.<br /> <br /> Some NOSFERATU of note...<br /> <br /> \u2022Pusfinger<br /> -The Masquerade is a simultaneously delicate and resilient thing. One too many corpses could create hunters yet decades of horror moves have numbed humans to the terrors of the night. Thus the Nosferatu prankster known as 'Pusfinger' has become a kindred celebrity amongst youths for their capacity to walk openly and spread images and videos over themselves and have the response of mortals be amazement and love for the kindred's 'special effects make-up skills'<br /> <br /> \u2022Uncle Smelly<br /> -One of the famous architects of SchreckNET, the Nosferatu whose chosen alter-ego is the most extreme caricature of a Nosferatu known to vampiric society. Still one of the prominent leaders of the digital network and a leader of the New York City warrens, 'Smelly' oversees a global network of information and prestation for the whole clan and its network.<br /> <br /> \u2022Cock Robin<br /> -The former Justicar, while Molly MacDonald claimed the position in 2011, still remains a radical opponent of the Anarch Movement and with the Sabbat on the decline in North America, this has given even more opportunity for Cock Robin to gain prominence within the Ivory Tower for leading militarized efforts against the Anarch Movement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-07T16:56:53-07:00","id":1386553,"title":"","content":"Taking some inspiration from the last post for this one, some notable figures who have been caught within the cobweb and serve as vessels for an ancient unknowable madness.<br /> <br /> Some MALKAVIANS of note...<br /> <br /> \u2022Rasputin<br /> -Perhaps the most infamous kindred urban legend, the mad monk's story has maintained the most resilient persistence amongst the Moon Clan who occasionally claim to have sited the figure throughout the streets of eastern europe or preaching to street congregations or in 'private sermons'. Many skoff at the claims, yet the stories continue.<br /> <br /> \u2022Vasantasena<br /> -The Gehenna Prophetess and one of the most prominent figures in the creation of the Sabbat, Vasantasena has been a leading Sabbat Loyalist and Noddist for centuries, disgusted by the corruption and politicking rampant within the sect. She is known known as a leader of the Gehenna Crusade in the Middle East as she strives to lead the Sword of Caine against the most ancient vampires lying torpid there.<br /> <br /> \u2022Crazy Jane<br /> -Another somewhat folkloric figure but more concrete then Rasputin is that of 'Crazy Jane' Pennington a Victorian woman turned malkavian who earned the favor of her clan for overturning despotic asylum domain keepers and helping young malkavians to learn to accept their curse, which she does to this night, although some wonder about the nature of her 'help' and her tendency to spread madless like a virulent.<br /> <br /> \u2022Malk Content<br /> -Perhaps the most infamous and well known of the Malkavian urban legends, stories of Malk Content cross the world. Spilling over into human urban legend and digital creepy pasta; stories attributed to Malk Content range from the odd or humorous to the blood-curdlingly horrific.<br /> <br /> \u2022Dr. Douglas Netchurch<br /> -A well known professional in the vampiric world and particularly the Camarilla, Douglas operates primarily in North America due to European elder's rumored disdain for him. Regardless, his studies are often fascinating to those seeking a modern answer to the vampiric condition and his work is followed closely as he strives to medically define vampirism.<br /> <br /> \u2022Anatole<br /> -The old medieval malkavian has gained a variety of reputations for his known contact with the famous Beckett, his status as a European folk saint, and his ties to contemporary and digital spiritual networks. While supposedly destroyed, many Malkavians report feeling a spiritual overseer hanging over their shoulder or a largely unknown figure posting on boards with Anatole's linguistic quirks.<br /> <br /> \u2022Bela<br /> -Bela is a strange guy. A known specter of Los Angeles, particularly old Hollywood, and a man who does bear a striking resemblance to the famed actor Bela Lugosi, his delusions as to being the infamous 'Count Dracula' have many kindred in stitches, particularly anarchs. Despite the violence and tensions of the West Coast Wars, Bela has surprisingly survived and gained a sort of cult celebrity amongst many young kindred across sect lines who follow his unlife with genuine delight and bemusement. He would surely have been destroyed long ago if it weren't for the fact he was generally harmless and that whoever killed him would suddenly become a villainous black hat for dozens if not hundreds of young vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T14:51:49-07:00","id":1386784,"title":"","content":"<b>Grimgroth </b>is in hiding, suspected (perhaps correctly) of having disabled the Prime Chantry's defenses. There's precedent. He pulled all the power out of Mistridge's wards, allowing the Craftmasons to destroy the place","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/100-jezmiller","name":"JezMiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"437"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T14:58:49-07:00","id":1386785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryffon15</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1386553#post1386553\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Taking some inspiration from the last post for this one, some notable figures who have been caught within the cobweb and serve as vessels for an ancient unknowable madness.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome job!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022Rasputin<br /> -Perhaps the most infamous kindred urban legend, the mad monk's story has maintained the most resilient persistence amongst the Moon Clan who occasionally claim to have sited the figure throughout the streets of eastern europe or preaching to street congregations or in 'private sermons'. Many skoff at the claims, yet the stories continue. </div> </div> </div>I think the Rasputin of BJD is not the actual Rasputin but just one of his many imposters. Why? Because the real Rasputin is not so easily intimidated by the Drowned. The &quot;real&quot; Rasputin is a prophet of Gehenna very similar to Anatole in his role as well as actions. He is currently opposed to the Brujah Council reforming that has tried to kill him repeatedly. As expected, he has proven very hard to kill permanently.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022Vasantasena<br /> -The Gehenna Prophetess and one of the most prominent figures in the creation of the Sabbat, Vasantasena has been a leading Sabbat Loyalist and Noddist for centuries, disgusted by the corruption and politicking rampant within the sect. She is known known as a leader of the Gehenna Crusade in the Middle East as she strives to lead the Sword of Caine against the most ancient vampires lying torpid there. </div> </div> </div>I actually have Vasantasena as one of the few vampires who has achieved Golconda but this makes her MORE likely to fight than less. She's one of the individuals who understands what the Paths were for.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022Bela<br /> -Bela is a strange guy. A known specter of Los Angeles, particularly old Hollywood, and a man who does bear a striking resemblance to the famed actor Bela Lugosi, his delusions as to being the infamous 'Count Dracula' have many kindred in stitches, particularly anarchs. Despite the violence and tensions of the West Coast Wars, Bela has surprisingly survived and gained a sort of cult celebrity amongst many young kindred across sect lines who follow his unlife with genuine delight and bemusement. He would surely have been destroyed long ago if it weren't for the fact he was generally harmless and that whoever killed him would suddenly become a villainous black hat for dozens if not hundreds of young vampires. </div> </div> </div>I actually have the real Bela Lugosi unrecognizable as a vampire since he's an old grey-haired man. He is bitter about his transformation but uses Obfuscate to disguise himself as his classic self when inclined.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T18:37:47-07:00","id":1386855,"title":"","content":"Ey these are also very cool CTPhipps! I'm always amused when Rasputin turns his head up once again and the idea about Vasantasena also makes sense to me along with the Bela idea which is just humorous in its own right.<br /> <br /> I'll have a fresh post up in here soonish, probably taken from my Gangrel list.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T19:49:15-07:00","id":1386879,"title":"","content":"From the wilds beyond and from the streets below, there are kindred who come stalking out and they are the beasts and outlanders, the survivor's brood.<br /> <br /> They are GANGREL...<br /> <br /> \u2022Xaviar<br /> -The once-justicar of Clan Gangrel who led the clan in an exodus from the Camarilla after they had discovered slumbering beasts below and in 1999 Xaviar and those who saw him as a worthy leader left the Camarilla. The Camarilla elected a new justicar in 2011, but in the meantime and into the modern day Xaviar is recognized as a leader of the Independent Gangrel and the modern culture of Gangrel outside the sects, mixing modern outlander temperments and a fear of the legendary beasts below. Xaviar is rarely seen but those few who report seeing him carry stories of cthonic beasts below the surface.<br /> <br /> \u2022Brynhild/Brunhilde<br /> -The leader of the Waelkyrige (Valkyries) and a descendant of the All High (Odin) who is known as a major Scandinavian warlord of Clan Gangrel leading the traditional viking faction of the clan in Scandinavia with a loose alliance with the regional Anarch Movement and carving their own territorial stretch throughout Scandinavia with colonies across the world amongst the Gangrel.<br /> <br /> \u2022Art Morgan<br /> -A well known wandering Gangrel and supposed knight, Art Morgan is a source of comedy to those who know of his Quixotian claims to the title of 'Justicar'. Known to have vast friendly ties and to be a chivalric wanderer, Art Morgan was rumored to be considered for the potential new title of Justicar but while young kindred are fond of him, he wasn't considered politically or morally capable to be a clan justicar.<br /> <br /> \u2022Karsh<br /> -One of the Gangrel who remained in the Camarilla after the Gangrel Exodus, Karsh was Imperator of the sect or leader of its warlords and Dux Bellorum. Known to be the sect's greatest war leader, rumors of his activity cross the globe, with the most common reports currently placing him either in Eastern Europe, Turkey, Southern Russia, or South America.<br /> <br /> \u2022Jalan-Aajav<br /> -One of the Sabbat's leading warlords and a noted Black Hand Seraph, known to be operating in the Middle East as a part of the Gehenna Crusade while leading hunting and warring expeditions in the Middle East while his agents in Central America trying to maintain access and control despite growing instability due to the migration of warriors.<br /> <br /> \u2022Beckett <br /> -One of the most significant and well-known Gangrel, an archaeologist and historian as well as a researcher of vampirism, Beckett is known amongst kindred of every sect for his discoveries and while the younger Camarilla members support his discoveries and past theories elders are less likely to be amused and some are driven into a fury. His writings and reports are often circulated by young kindred as one of the most valuable sources of vampiric information many kindred have.<br /> <br /> \u2022Geoffrey Leigh<br /> -Once a well known archon and now the Justicar of Clan Gangrel as of 2011, Geoffrey Leigh now has the unfortunate responsibility of trying to draw the Outlander Gangrel back into the sect of the Camarilla. This has placed him in the unfortunate position as a formerly prominent archon of Victorian politics tasked with drawing several indigenous factions, the Scandinavian vikings, warrior cultures, and Xaviar's followers back to the Camarilla while many of <br /> them were drawn into the Sabbat or Anarch Movement. His results have been... varied.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T20:14:41-07:00","id":1386887,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Haberdasher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1385812#post1385812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Victoria Ash is sitting in the Tehran haven she shares with Tegyrius, and she's bored out of her skull. She sympathizes with Iranian mortals who push for a more liberal culture, because currently what passes for a party in Tehran is horribly dull. She knows too much is at stake to start cheating on Tegyrius with somebody, but <i>God</i> if the thought isn't tempting.</div> </div> </div> </div>HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!!!!!!!!!!!!!! You dug your grave honey.......now go lie in it...............<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2582,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2582-gangrel44","user":"Gangrel44","date":". 05-08-2020, 11:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2582-gangrel44","name":"Gangrel44","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-11T00:46:48-07:00","id":1387432,"title":"","content":"Some more NPC ideas:<br /> <br /> * <b>Menele</b> has felt the Beckoning and returned to Carthage to discover his sire <b>Troile</b> alive and well or at least her astral projection. He is now serving as a warlord for her in the Gehenna War and losing Humanity (Path of Entelechy?) slaughtering Sabbat and <b>True Brujah</b> for her. He is deeply troubled by the fact that <b>Moloch</b>'s presence is something that he also feels.<br /> <br /> * <b>Moloch</b> has successfully taken over the <b>True Hand</b> due to the fact the <b>Aralu</b> are not actually sleeping Antediluvians but they are his childer. The Underworld Enoch is actually the Baali's former city of Acheron. He has effectively rebuilt the Baali's former strength and the True Hand is now his vessel for seeking out infernal relics and working to put demons back to sleep. Moloch has also devoted himself to Troile.<br /> <br /> * Speaking of the True Hand: The Harbingers, Nagaraja, and True Brujah all went &quot;Nope. Buh byyeeee&quot; when the Baali were accepted by them. This proved to be a wise decision.<br /> <br /> * <b>Shaitan</b> awoke in Mexico City and proceeded to eat a large chunk of the Sabbat there before seemingly being killed by the Second Inquisition working with Imbued. Stories abound that it was Sullivan Dane wielding the Sword of Leopod. Sullivan is less than confidant that he killed Shaitan or that such a demonic creature can be killed but he killed <i>something</i> very old and powerful. The loss of so many Sabbat to the 4th gen's appetite is also why Mexico City fell to the Camarilla.<br /> <br /> The Drowned alternatively claim Shaitan was always just <b>Hu\u012btzil\u014dp\u014dchtli</b> and was never a Baali or that they destroyed the imposter. If the former is true, the ancient may have rejoined them.<br /> <br /> * <b>Mictlantecuhtli</b>, after destroying a bunch of diablerist Anarch idiots in 1992, has finally shrugged off his thirty-year-wake up. The Drowned Bloodline founder has since gone to rejoin his fellows and begin taking back Central America from the Sabbat. He's a bit bewildered by things like, uh, Christianity, let alone technology but is adapting nevertheless.<br /> <br /> * <b>Dracula</b> finally killed <b>Kupala</b> permanently. As such, all Tzimisce no longer have the instinctive need to be complete assholes and Vicissitude is now much harder. He's not sure what affect this has had on the Eldest, though. who had apparently been feeding off the Archdemon for literally millennia. Dracula has since left the Inconnu and is now exploring the New World, looking for brides.<br /> <br /> * <b>Inyanga</b> was not Beckoned but simply returned to Africa where she emerged a few months later as the representative of the Laibon Alliance. Effectively, she is now ambassador to the Camarilla from Africa's Kindred despite their failry loosely organized nature. The primary job she has is trying to convince them that they already HAVE a Kindred society, thank you very much, so stop acting like it doesn't exist or is unexplored territory.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 05-11-2020, 04:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-11T01:00:43-07:00","id":1387435,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryffon15</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1386879#post1386879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From the wilds beyond and from the streets below, there are kindred who come stalking out and they are the beasts and outlanders, the survivor's brood.<br /> <br /> They are GANGREL...</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooo, I appreciate you doing this.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022Xaviar<br /> -The once-justicar of Clan Gangrel who led the clan in an exodus from the Camarilla after they had discovered slumbering beasts below and in 1999 Xaviar and those who saw him as a worthy leader left the Camarilla. The Camarilla elected a new justicar in 2011, but in the meantime and into the modern day Xaviar is recognized as a leader of the Independent Gangrel and the modern culture of Gangrel outside the sects, mixing modern outlander temperments and a fear of the legendary beasts below. Xaviar is rarely seen but those few who report seeing him carry stories of cthonic beasts below the surface. </div> </div> </div>My version is that Xavier was ultimately the reason the Anarchs joined the Movement despite the fact that he was personally opposed to anything but independence. Xavier was foolishly added to the Red List by the Ventrue as part of their rage-quit after Hardestadt's assassination. He was only on it for a few days when Alastors murdered him under a flag of truce and incited hundreds of Gangrel to defect to the Anarchs. It remains one of the most appalling boneheaded and stupid moves ever done by the Camarilla and some believe it had to have been arranged.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022Brynhild/Brunhilde<br /> -The leader of the Waelkyrige (Valkyries) and a descendant of the All High (Odin) who is known as a major Scandinavian warlord of Clan Gangrel leading the traditional viking faction of the clan in Scandinavia with a loose alliance with the regional Anarch Movement and carving their own territorial stretch throughout Scandinavia with colonies across the world amongst the Gangrel. </div> </div> </div>Brunhilde finds the Anarch/Camarilla divide to be a bit like a WW2 veteran would find modern politics. It's all a bit silly to someone who knows that vampires are gods not mere mortals. As such, she basically teaches Anarchs to be warriors who murder, pillage, and conquer as well as die in a glorious cause. They're clay to her presence and any deeper ideology is largely lost to those who are enamored of her presence. As such, her &quot;Anarchs&quot; are more like a Blood Cult of Aesir in upswing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022Art Morgan<br /> -A well known wandering Gangrel and supposed knight, Art Morgan is a source of comedy to those who know of his Quixotian claims to the title of 'Justicar'. Known to have vast friendly ties and to be a chivalric wanderer, Art Morgan was rumored to be considered for the potential new title of Justicar but while young kindred are fond of him, he wasn't considered politically or morally capable to be a clan justicar. </div> </div> </div>Given there IS no Clan Justicar anymore for the Gangrel, Loyalists have effectively been letting him fill the role anyway. Given his complete lack of Beckoning and willingness to carry out the duties, he's ironically gained more favor than he ever did before. If there ever were enough Gangrel to warrant such a title, he'd probably get it. Ironically, this has resulted in the Lasombra and Banu Haqim debating whether he should be taken care of.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022Karsh<br /> -One of the Gangrel who remained in the Camarilla after the Gangrel Exodus, Karsh was Imperator of the sect or leader of its warlords and Dux Bellorum. Known to be the sect's greatest war leader, rumors of his activity cross the globe, with the most common reports currently placing him either in Eastern Europe, Turkey, Southern Russia, or South America. </div> </div> </div>Karsh is notable for being one of the rare Elders who went to the Middle East BY CHOICE to lead the Camarilla armies in the Gehenna War against the Sabbat. The Ashirra basically received him and have let him carry out his battle strategies from Jordan, Egypt, Jerusalem, and other locations even as he seems completely oblivious to the Antediluvians hand in things or just doesn't care.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022Jalan-Aajav<br /> -One of the Sabbat's leading warlords and a noted Black Hand Seraph, known to be operating in the Middle East as a part of the Gehenna Crusade while leading hunting and warring expeditions in the Middle East while his agents in Central America trying to maintain access and control despite growing instability due to the migration of warriors. </div> </div> </div>Jalan Aajav is notable for being one of the rare Elders who went to the Middle East BY CHOICE to lead the Sabbat armies in the Gehenna War against the Camarilla. The Ashirra basically received him and have let him carry out his battle strategies from Jordan, Egypt, Jerusalem, and other locations even as he seems completely oblivious to the Antediluvians hand in things or just doesn't care.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022Beckett<br /> -One of the most significant and well-known Gangrel, an archaeologist and historian as well as a researcher of vampirism, Beckett is known amongst kindred of every sect for his discoveries and while the younger Camarilla members support his discoveries and past theories elders are less likely to be amused and some are driven into a fury. His writings and reports are often circulated by young kindred as one of the most valuable sources of vampiric information many kindred have. </div> </div> </div>Beckett has spent the past ten years or so living a video game life with his new apprentice, <b>Jenna Cross</b>, as she has since abandoned her role as a Thin Blood leader to try to solve the riddle of Gehenna. They've found dozens of tombs, some empty and some less so, while fighting their way through armies of Sabbat as well as mortal cultists. Indiana Jones and Lara Croft jokes abound for both of them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022Geoffrey Leigh<br /> -Once a well known archon and now the Justicar of Clan Gangrel as of 2011, Geoffrey Leigh now has the unfortunate responsibility of trying to draw the Outlander Gangrel back into the sect of the Camarilla. This has placed him in the unfortunate position as a formerly prominent archon of Victorian politics tasked with drawing several indigenous factions, the Scandinavian vikings, warrior cultures, and Xaviar's followers back to the Camarilla while many of<br /> them were drawn into the Sabbat or Anarch Movement. His results have been... varied. </div> </div> </div>In my games, Geoffrey decided to face the Inquisition head on in London and show the mortals who was really in charge. He hasn't been seen since. Violetta is worried that the Second Inquisition killed him but even more worried that a revived Mithras has taken his loyalty from the Camarilla to his cult.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-11T13:49:14-07:00","id":1387581,"title":"","content":"These are really cool stuff CTPhipps and thank ya for your interest in my own stuff!<br /> <br /> I do think it's interesting how different contexts and personal tastes can serve as prisms to create takes on different characters that are recognizably the same, somewhat akin to the various titles Greek gods were invoked by or comic book superheroes.<br /> <br /> I need to check my notes to see what list I've got next but I believe it was probably the Tremere which should be fun!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-11T14:35:05-07:00","id":1387591,"title":"","content":"Yes, your stuff is really good and better than some of mine. Can't wait.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T22:38:45-07:00","id":1387912,"title":"","content":"<b>Capone</b><br /> <br /> Al Capone faked a vampire of his bloodline being tossed in a oil barrel and dumped into Lake Michigan. However, Al Capone did suffer several close calls with the Second Inquisition as the<b> Special Affairs Division </b>has discovered proof positive that he was a vampire as well as responsible for much of the Midwest drug trade. The FBI vs. Al Capone is something that far too many agents have taken an interest in and it's made his efforts to expand his power extremely boxed in. He hasn't been caught or even had any close calls but a couple of his grandchilder plus several mortal businesses.<br /> <br /> Al has decided that he needs to permanently change his appearance and identity. To this end, he is seeking out shapechangers, flesh-crafters, and some Nosferatu in hopes of finding a way to permanently bring an end to his Masquerade-breaking existence. He's also considering adopting a permanent &quot;new&quot; identity and alias. However, he knows it will also require leaving Chicago and setting up somewhere else.<br /> <br /> There is another option, though. Al has been in contact with a mysterious Kindred woman named <b>Rebekah</b> who has stated that the mysterious <b>Inconnu</b> might be a shelter for him. Al could leave regular Kindred society for a century or more in order to study things like Golconda, power, and more. While he isn't sure he could give up normal society or feed regularly in the Eastern mountains, it's a tempting out to just stop being trapped in his old life.<br /> <br /> Little does he know he's also being scouted by another group, the <b>Pisanob</b>, who would be happy to provide him his old life in spades. Italin villas in the old country, pimps, hookers, drugs, guns, and ways to make sure he will never be recognized.<br /> <br /> Beyond that, Kevin Jackson has already figured out that <b>Al Capone</b> is probably alive and is keeping it close to his vest. Announcing his continued unlife would make him weak and he very much would like someone to take care of Al for him quietly. This time, he intends to make it stick and whoever does it will receive a great reward.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 05-13-2020, 02:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T21:31:34-07:00","id":1388557,"title":"","content":"Impassioned and urbane, the weave of of kindred society, from the salons of the Camarilla to the rallies of the Anarch Movement the clan of the Rose is beloved wherever it treads... or else.<br /> <br /> \u2022Rafael de Coraz\u00f3n<br /> -Perhaps the most publicly prominent of the Inner Circle, Rafael is still famed within the Camarilla and vampiric society in general as one of the architects of the Masquerade. While the Inner Circle is subtle by nature, Rafael is something of a voice for them, so that when he speaks it is rare but known to carry the word of the Camarilla's leadership on whatever issue he raises up.<br /> <br /> \u2022Madame Guil<br /> -One of the most (in)famous of the Justicars, Madame Guil is one of the longest tenured Justicars and while she has recently vanished from the public eye, Guil in her time was known to be one of the most capable scouts for Camarilla traitors. Her current wearsbouts and circumstances are unknown with rumors floating that a conspiracy within the Ivory Tower may have turned against her.<br /> <br /> \u2022Derrick Zeel<br /> -While some speculate he's an urban legend, Derrick Zeel is almost synonymous amongst toreador for those who feed primarily through sex or herds. Sharing herds, connecting blood dolls, and just general erotic arts in general; Derrick is either famous or infamous for his ability to get anyone anything with a pulse if you can contact him... those who are uncertain about his methods are less likely to be fond of him. Contact is difficult enough that even being able to reach him through intermediaries is something of a status symbol, particularly since he's incredibly difficult to reach due to how many people might decide to put an end to him and his business.<br /> <br /> \u2022Geneveve Orseau<br /> -While sometimes considered a 'poseur', Geneveve Orseau is famous within the toreador artist community both as a patron and collector. Anyone whose works are housed in one of her many galleries around the world gains immediate clan prestiege and her tastes do a great deal to drive both clan and global culture. Her role within clan culture through organizing great salons and balls also cannot be understated.<br /> <br /> \u2022Lucy Cannon<br /> -One of the younger well known toreador leader, Lucy Cannon is young enough to have once been a prominent HBO comedian and is now a famous vampiric satirist, something that strangely unites both kindred young and old behind her popularity. However her nasty habit of barbing kindred who displease her into public frenzies has created something of an uncertain ambience around her, with a particular displeasure amongst clan Tremere. Still the wandering comedian works her way across domains, granting a significant prestige to wherever she visits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T03:44:40-07:00","id":1388635,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryffon15</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1388557#post1388557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Impassioned and urbane, the weave of of kindred society, from the salons of the Camarilla to the rallies of the Anarch Movement the clan of the Rose is beloved wherever it treads... or else.</div> </div> </div> </div>Excellent collection of Toreador updates.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022Rafael de Coraz\u00f3n<br /> -Perhaps the most publicly prominent of the Inner Circle, Rafael is still famed within the Camarilla and vampiric society in general as one of the architects of the Masquerade. While the Inner Circle is subtle by nature, Rafael is something of a voice for them, so that when he speaks it is rare but known to carry the word of the Camarilla's leadership on whatever issue he raises up. </div> </div> </div>My take on Rafael is pretty dark. Rafael has been on an Italian island for the past few years with hundreds of security guards and Archons who could be assisting the Camarilla. The death of Hardestadt and weakening of the Camarilla has terrified him but not so much as the Beckoning, which he feels. Rafael has taken to regularly diablerizing Thin Bloods as a &quot;cure&quot; for his condition as well as hosting elaborate blood orgies every night to take his mind off events. It's actually working to hold the Beckoning away but has caused his Humanity to plummet. If he doesn't stop, he will likely become a wight. Already Malkavians wearing bloodstained shrouds have begun appearing in his visions and reciting Poe at him.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u2022Madame Guil<br /> -One of the most (in)famous of the Justicars, Madame Guil is one of the longest tenured Justicars and while she has recently vanished from the public eye, Guil in her time was known to be one of the most capable scouts for Camarilla traitors. Her current wearsbouts and circumstances are unknown with rumors floating that a conspiracy within the Ivory Tower may have turned against her. </div> </div> </div>Madame Guil's defection to the Sabbat couldn't have come at a worse time really. She really should have stuck with the Camarilla. She's since been Beckoned but is also fighting in the Gehenna Wars so there's some wiggle room if she wanted to actually make a defection back. A few know that she's defected but the irony is the majority of her enemies are meeting their ends at the hands of Sabbat fangs in the same war she's fighting.<br /> <br /> Love the others you did as well, especially Lucy Cannon.<br /> <br /> <b>Francois Villon</b><br /> <br /> The Prince of Paris broke his Blood Bond to Helena when she diablerized a bunch of Vermillion Wedding guests with his help. He's kept this a secret but is grateful that he isn't feeling the Call to the Middle East so many other Kindred have. Unfortunately, Francois is suffering other problems as the Second Inquisition has actually managed to turn him into their puppet.<br /> <br /> Agents in the French government have made a &quot;deal&quot; with him to purge the country of a large number of Kindred while leaving him and his own alone if he cooperates. His attempts to manipulate them failed badly due to the fact he was still recovering from his newfound freedom and they now have evidence about him turning over several powerful Camarilla elders as well as Anarchs, Thin Bloods, and &quot;rabble.&quot;<br /> <br /> Worse, his powers are significantly weakened so that he is only as strong as a minor 7th or 8th generation Elder rather than the 5th generation juggernaut he used to be. As such, he's giving them much more help than he actually needs to in hopes of weakening his rivals for control of France. He also suspects that the &quot;Second Inquisition&quot; may actually just be a front for someone much older or stronger.<br /> <br /> Is <b>Alexander</b> of the Ventrue truly dead?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T09:17:40-07:00","id":1388697,"title":"","content":"Honestly something I've gone back and forth on and ultimately ended up outside of my toreador post was Melinda Galbraith because of her whole situation <br /> <br /> I won't say exactly what it is, on the off chance someone doesn't want to know, but keeping it canon has made me less likely to do a write-up for her specifically. It also just feels in general that her situation is ultimately less necessary in a timeline without Gehenna striking in 04-05 and with chaos like the Gehenna Crusade doing just fine on their own to stir things up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T06:11:02-07:00","id":1391176,"title":"","content":"<b>Christof Romuald</b> successfully slew the 5th Generation <b>Vukodlak</b> due to a combation of the Brujah having incredibly potent combat abilties, the Ainkurn Sword, a group of fellow vampires backing him up, the Vukoladak's incredible arrogance, torpor weariness, and the sabotage of the Tzimsice Methueslah's blood supply by <b>Aneska</b>. Christof proceeded to Embrace Aneska and attempted to resume their relationship.<br /> <br /> Unfortuantely, Christof found that 800 years of ghouldom had not left Aneska unchanged. Rather than the sweet innocent he remembered, she was a calculating hedonistic manipulator. Believing the rise of Gehenna was nigh, Aneska abandoned Christof to join the Sabbat. Unwilling or unable to follow her, Christof entered a deep funk and ended up joining the Camarilla as an Archon due to its feudal familiarity.<br /> <br /> Having since rejoined with <b>Ecaterina the Wise</b>, he's surprised her by actually helping her regain some of her long-lost humanity. The struggle between her centuries of Sabbat cruelty and Christof's earnest devotion to &quot;good&quot; (albeit, a Medieval French nobleman's idea) have worn down much of her defenses. She also finds him impossible to manipulate due to his straightforward blunt approach to...everything.<br /> <br /> A romance might have sparked between his mentor and him if not for the fact that his heart remains heavy over Aneska and he's heard of her brutal deeds in the Gehenna Crusade. &quot;The Red Nun&quot; has devoured dozens of Camarilla Elders and several ancients supposedly.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T06:12:40-07:00","id":1391178,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryffon15</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1388697#post1388697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly something I've gone back and forth on and ultimately ended up outside of my toreador post was Melinda Galbraith because of her whole situation<br /> <br /> I won't say exactly what it is, on the off chance someone doesn't want to know, but keeping it canon has made me less likely to do a write-up for her specifically. It also just feels in general that her situation is ultimately less necessary in a timeline without Gehenna striking in 04-05 and with chaos like the Gehenna Crusade doing just fine on their own to stir things up.</div> </div> </div> </div>I suspect they offed her because White Wolf was very interested in making the Sabbat the no. 2# playable faction. Having an Infernalist as the Sabbat's leader undermined their claims of being an equally valid sect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T13:23:35-07:00","id":1391245,"title":"","content":"That's valid, I suppose it's one of those things that even more then usual relies upon personal preference. I personally prefer Galbraith as a Regent over shifting the metaplot into the Fourth Sabbat Civil War but I can definitely see why people would like the balkanization of the sect and the opportunity to change its direction but kinda like situations like the War For Concordia that's the sort of thing I'd rather leave to individual STs and chronicles.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'll probably pull out my notes again and get ready to post something for Clan Tremere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T13:32:00-07:00","id":1391251,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryffon15</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1391245#post1391245\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's valid, I suppose it's one of those things that even more then usual relies upon personal preference. I personally prefer Galbraith as a Regent over shifting the metaplot into the Fourth Sabbat Civil War but I can definitely see why people would like the balkanization of the sect and the opportunity to change its direction but kinda like situations like the War For Concordia that's the sort of thing I'd rather leave to individual STs and chronicles.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'll probably pull out my notes again and get ready to post something for Clan Tremere.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think Lucita was meant to be Regent or at least Regent of the PC's faction of the Sabbat with the original 4th Edition plan.<br /> <br /> However, in my game, Polonia is the Regent of the Sabbat and that's why the Gehenna Crusade took off. Only the Regent could order such a huge chunk of the Sabbat to the Middle East.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T16:10:40-07:00","id":1391324,"title":"","content":"I posted this a while ago:<br /> <br /> <b>Dominique Tourain</b> has gone Anarch. She's basically a holdover from the original Anarch Revolt who saw the Sabbat as the first Anarch Movement, only to watch her sect morph over the centuries from something that was about freedom from elder tyranny to exactly the opposite, a heavily top-down organization dominated by its own elders. She'd harbored a lot of doubts about the Sabbat for a while (<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3046_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3046\" data-vbnamecard=\"3046\">Black Fox</a> made an excellent post <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1151053-information-on-the-early-sabbat?p=1151104#post1151104\">here</a> about its evolution and increasingly authoritarian leadership over the centuries), but always hoped she could push it back towards its roots. She never could. No elders wanted to give up power and the neonates were shitheads with about as much regard for human life as toilet paper. Melinda Galbraith's assassination gave her some hope for the first time in a while, and she made a bid to become regent (as partly detailed in Beckett's Jyhad Diary) that was ultimately unsuccessful. The start of the Gehenna Crusade was the final nail in the coffin to her belief the Sabbat was about freedom, and convinced her the sect could never be reformed. The Anarchs were on the upswing, so she jumped ship.<br /> <br /> She wishes she'd thought to do that hundreds of years ago. She could have been an arguably better MacNeil than MacNeil, making her wisdom and experience available to the sect without actually forbidding its members from establishing a working system of government like the Scotsman essentially did. <br /> <br /> I also like <b>Temoch the Jackal</b>, a persona in METS, as the regent for the Sabbat. He's supposed to have been Embraced in the Mexican War of Independence, which is really darn young for a Sabbat regent. How is that so? You could say he's just a puppet of some elder prisci, but this is the Sabbat. I rationalize it as him basically being one of the most successful diablerists in the history of the sect--he started at basically dirt (Jes\u00fas Alcal\u00e1, the 13th gen Gangrel antitirbu from Mexico City by Night, is his younger broodmate) and simply devoured one elder after another until he was at the top of the food chain. (It's a minor peeve of mine that most canon diablerists were usually Embraced at pretty low gen to begin with. Where's the love for the &quot;less privileged&quot; Embraces?) The Gehenna Crusade and the chance it posed to climb up even higher was irresistible to him. Having been Embraced during a decade-long revolution and made his bones during the later Mexican Revolution, he's used to constant turmoil and conflict, as well as to leading underdogs against a superior foe. That background combined with his experience hunting and diablerizing elders makes him perhaps the most qualified regent there is to lead the Sabbat in its present new form. <br /> <br /> Or perhaps the worst qualified, if all those devoured ancients aren't all just &quot;pulling a Mithras&quot; on their murderers. The Sabbat has essentially gambled its entire future as a sect on that not happening in significant numbers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T19:08:24-07:00","id":1391387,"title":"","content":"Tiamat, of Bloody Hearts: DiablerieBritain, survived the attempt on her existence. She would wake, reincorporate into the modern world and under the influence of the demon Drakonskyr would move to LA and become a producer of the various &quot;Real Wives of...&quot; shows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T19:11:27-07:00","id":1391390,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1391387#post1391387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tiamat, of Bloody Hearts: DiablerieBritain, survived the attempt on her existence. She would wake, reincorporate into the modern world and under the influence of the demon Drakonskyr would move to LA and become a producer of the various &quot;Real Wives of...&quot; shows.</div> </div> </div> </div>Truly this is the worst timeline.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-25T04:40:03-07:00","id":1391460,"title":"","content":"imo, <b>Galbraith</b> was overrated,<br /> she had the cool factor for being the antitribu regent and a woman, a symbol of mexico city as the city of women, as the leaders of the sabbat in mexico were female<br /> <br /> the issue is...that's it, that's all she was, just a symbol,<br /> her policies weren't her own, any initiative of hers could be credited to either Gorchist or Shaitan,<br /> and her contribution to the sabbat could be summed up as her attending the ritae and nodding at every one of the BlackHand/Tal'mahe'ra demands,<br /> we don't know what motivates her, we don't know what she thinks of the sabbat or what she wants with shaitan,<br /> <br /> she was the embodiment of &quot;just sit and look pretty&quot;, which is fitting for a Toreador but...heh<br /> (I know, this can be fixed by the ST, and I know it might be the point of this thread, but I'm talking canon rn)<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Temoch</b> was...just as bad imo, but for very different reasons,<br /> <br /> Temoch is too perfect, he's everything a sabbat could hope to be and he doesn't even pretend, he is 100% legit,<br /> he's relatively young, antitribu, faithful to the cause, strong, and got his position with strength and...yeah, he's a saint<br /> <br /> he has zero flaws, he's too perfect, no trace of corruption, nothing...he's boring is what I'm saying<br /> <br /> <br /> the regency candidates in Mexico by Night were more interesting imo,<br /> they had motivations and strengths, but also flaws, doubts, double dealings, hypocrisies and insecurities<br /> <br /> I'm not 100% sure about the ones in BJD, but to me they feel like <b>Temoch </b>types, in other words mary sues,<br /> and, while I have nothing against mary sues (they can make great characters, especially as antagonists, and they're the norm for most canon npcs in 1st ed/2nd ed),<br /> I can't help but be more interested in the others","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":10998,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","user":"Pleiades","date":". 05-25-2020, 07:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-30T20:54:14-07:00","id":1405461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1391178#post1391178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I suspect they offed her because White Wolf was very interested in making the Sabbat the no. 2# playable faction. Having an Infernalist as the Sabbat's leader undermined their claims of being an equally valid sect.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Actually, there are some funny salient bits on this story.<br /> The &quot;Melinda Regent of the Sabbat&quot; cited in 1st edition was supposed to be Lasombra and a big deal was made of how all regents up to that point had been from &quot;the Sabbat clans&quot; (Lasombra &amp; Tzimisce).<br /> Meanwhile in Chaos Factor, the first book to adress Mexico City in WoD, we have Melinda Galbraith, a <i>Toreador Antitribu</i> <b>Cardinal</b>, that happens to secretly be an infernalist, due to centuries of stealth brainwashing by the Baali methuselah Shaitan (what is kind of hilarious, because Helena's notes in CbN describe a dominate elder power <i>to counter exactly that</i>, if memory tricks me not). Going just by those bits of book info they could - should - have been completely different characters that just happen to share the first name. Damn, one of the Tremere Councilors is called <i>Meerlinda </i>and no one theorizes she's secretly the Sabbat Regent (wouldn't that be a crazy twist?!).<br /> <br /> Honestly, Galbraith as the Regent of the Sabbat always reeked of runaway memetic mutation to me. Yeah, canon evolves, changes and its mostly a matter of personal taste anyway, but i like to stick to that.<br /> <br /> Yeah, kind of hypocritical of my part, considering i retconned Dmitri (the Malkavian 4th gen chess aficionado and Sabbat leader from Succubus Club adventure Player of Pawns) and his followers as a Lasombra <i>Amici Noctis</i> cabal in my own games, but cut a guy some slack...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 07-31-2020, 12:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T02:04:10-07:00","id":1405522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405461#post1405461\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Actually, there are some funny salient bits on this story.<br /> The &quot;Melinda Regent of the Sabbat&quot; cited in 1st edition was supposed to be Lasombra and a big deal was made of how all regents up to that point had been from &quot;the Sabbat clans&quot; (Lasombra &amp; Tzimisce).<br /> Meanwhile in Chaos Factor, the first book to adress Mexico City in WoD, we have Melinda Galbraith, a <i>Toreador Antitribu</i> <b>Cardinal</b>, that happens to secretly be an infernalist, due to centuries of stealth brainwashing by the Baali methuselah Shaitan (what is kind of hilarious, because Helena's notes in CbN describe a dominate elder power <i>to counter exactly that</i>, if memory tricks me not). Going just by those bits of book info they could - should - have been completely different characters that just happen to share the first name. Damn, one of the Tremere Councilors is called <i>Meerlinda </i>and no one theorizes she's secretly the Sabbat Regent (wouldn't that be a crazy twist?!).<br /> <br /> Honestly, Galbraith as the Regent of the Sabbat always reeked of runaway memetic mutation to me. Yeah, canon evolves, changes and its mostly a matter of personal taste anyway, but i like to stick to that.<br /> <br /> Yeah, kind of hypocritical of my part, considering i retconned Dmitri (the Malkavian 4th gen chess aficionado and Sabbat leader from Succubus Club adventure Player of Pawns) and his followers as a Lasombra <i>Amici Noctis</i> cabal in my own games, but cut a guy some slack...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I admit, I love the idea of a Toreador Regent.<br /> <br /> Mind you, it shouldn't be that hard for a 5th Generation Infernalist to take over the sect.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T05:06:30-07:00","id":1405549,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405522#post1405522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I admit, I love the idea of a Toreador Regent.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, i don't mind it on itself, on the contrary, it's all the little continuity inconsistencies, together with the lack of a clear character/narrative of her own that bothers me.<br /> Melinda's history as written is <b>not </b>about her but things done to her by others. She's a pawn made queen and kind of hollow at that, a serious shame and missed opportunity imho.<br /> <br /> Had <b>more </b>been done of the &quot;first antitribu Regent!&quot; angle - to make it more clearly a thing and <b>not </b>an accident of character conflation - and we given an <b>actual </b>history of hers, one that went beyond her title, sire and/or master, i would totally root for her.<br /> <br /> (Ok, i'll also admit her stats - high atributes, low-ish skills, a bunch of elder powers <i>with no description</i> - also bother me a lot)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405522#post1405522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mind you, it shouldn't be that hard for a 5th Generation Infernalist to take over the sect.</div> </div> </div> </div>This i have more of a issue with. &quot;Oh, she's a 5th gen elder - not really a methuselah - ergo taking over sect leadership shouldn't be too much of a challenge to her.&quot;<br /> &quot;Awesomeness by dots&quot; is something i took issue with and probably always will, i guess.<br /> <br /> edit: re-reading her sheet i just noticed the Occult 3 (now i'm imagining her constantly faking mystic know-how she doesn't know or care for - or tricking it out of people who do have) and <b><i>Computer 4</i></b>. In recognition of this awesomely salient bit of incongruity/flavor/unexpected, it's now my personal headcanon that Galbraith faked her death, for the sake of personal freedom and to fully dedicate her time to perfecting her internet persona and skills. Also in a fling/rivalry with Zipper from LA and Bobby Weatherbottom from Chicago. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 07-31-2020, 08:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T05:30:51-07:00","id":1405551,"title":"","content":"A couple of points:<br /> <br /> 1. I believe Melinda is actually masquerading as a Lasombra so she's not known to be a Toreador Antitribu.<br /> <br /> 2. She could have killed her way to the Regency after Chaos Factor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T06:05:56-07:00","id":1405556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405551#post1405551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A couple of points:<br /> <br /> 1. I believe Melinda is actually masquerading as a Lasombra so she's not known to be a Toreador Antitribu.</div> </div> </div> </div>A common answer/fan theory to get around the continuity issues i initially mentioned.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405551#post1405551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. She could have killed her way to the Regency after Chaos Factor.</div> </div> </div> </div>So from '93 to '01 she went from Cardinal to Regent to bloodstain on the floor - and we get little to no story out of this?<br /> See what i'm getting at?<br /> <br /> Also, those are us fans of the game stopgaping the holes. Again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"k