 target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T06:35:19-07:00","id":1405559,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405556#post1405556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So from '93 to '01 she went from Cardinal to Regent to bloodstain on the floor - and we get little to no story out of this?<br /> See what i'm getting at?</div> </div> </div> </div>iirc, the regent IS the cardinal of mexico<br /> <br /> and, regardless of her being antitribu or not, chaos factor should be retconned, and that's that","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T06:43:01-07:00","id":1405562,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405559#post1405559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> iirc, the regent IS the cardinal of mexico</div> </div> </div> </div>Is it, double booking? Must make for an hell of an administrative agenda. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405559#post1405559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">and, regardless of her being antitribu or not, chaos factor should be retconned, and that's that</div> </div> </div> </div>Possibly, but care to delve on your reasons for saying so?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405557#post1405557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eh, that's why these forums exist.</div> </div> </div> </div>True. Anyway, i would really appreciate if someone took the time to adress/hang a lampshade on these little issues of Melinda's background - when did she become regent, did she fake being Lasombra for some undefined period of time or was there a precursor with the same first name leading to the confusion, etc - and give her some <i>actual </i>backstory that is <b>not </b>other more powerful kindred doing things to her (being shangaied to the Americas, then dumped on Mexico city by Helena, brainwashed into going Path of Evil Revelations by Shaitan/Huitzilopochtli from torpor, etc) while at it.<br /> <br /> Like, what was she doing in the almost four centuries between her embrace (1143) and coming to Mexico in the time of Cort\u00e9s' conquest (1519-1521)?<br /> Also, why did Helena pick a probably scottish childe, instead of the mediterranean ones (Maria, Consuela, Eletria, possibly Alexandria) ones, that should have much easier time blending in, to stay in the city? When and how did Melinda join the Sabbat, since she most probably was not when she arrived in the continent under Helena's wing?<br /> <br /> Lots of spots to adress with her, both in what is written and what is not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 02-02-2026, 11:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T06:46:15-07:00","id":1405563,"title":"","content":"I admit it's pure headcanon but my take on her background is:<br /> <br /> * She was Embraced by Helena to be one of her Herd like so many others.<br /> <br /> * She joined the Sabbat in order to escape the Blood Bond to Helena.<br /> <br /> * While living in Mexico City, she was contacted by Shaitan and corrupted.<br /> <br /> * Much of her infernalism is driven by a desire to never be enslaved by her sire again.<br /> <br /> * Her infernalism gave her the power to assassinate the previous Regent and make herself so.<br /> <br /> * She uses Dark Thaumaturgy to impersonate a Lasombra.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T08:38:40-07:00","id":1405585,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405562#post1405562\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Possibly, but care to delve on your reasons for saying so?</div> </div> </div> </div>too over the top, typical 2nd ed sabbat with infernalists everywhere, mindlessly violent sabbat, and the weird crossovers<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> True. Anyway, i would really appreciate if someone took the time to adress/hang a lampshade on these little issues of Melinda's background - when did she become regent, did she fake being Lasombra for some undefined period of time or was there a precursor with the same first name leading to the confusion, etc - and give her some <i>actual </i>backstory that is <b>not </b>other more powerful kindred doing things to her (being shangaied to the Americas, then dumped on Mexico city by Helena, brainwashed into going Path of Evil Revelations by Shaitan/Huitzilopochtli from torpor, etc) while at it. </div> </div> </div>the Shaitan thing was never explained,<br /> she was abandoned by helena after helena discovered shaitan and ran away,<br /> she joined the sabbat to break the bond<br /> <br /> later she became a crusader and was instrumental in the sabbat's success in the east coast<br /> <br /> during the sabbat civil war, she and her followers, with the help of the black hand, worked to put an end to the hostilities,<br /> by the end of the civil war, she gathered enough support to become regent around 1910, she ruled for most of the 20th century and put in motion a revised<br /> version of gorchist's code of milan that allowed the black hand more freedom from the sabbat<br /> <br /> PS: I don't remember where I read any of this, so take it with a grain of salt...also, she's a boring regent<br /> <br /> <b>Encyclopaedia Vampirica (2002)</b> mentions she's a toreador antitribu that claimed to be lasombra...God knows how<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T11:06:27-07:00","id":1405620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405585#post1405585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Shaitan thing was never explained,</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't see why swearing yourself to a being like Shaitan is particularly hard to fathom. If you're a vampire, you're going to encounter beings who give you a choice of immense riches and power or death.<br /> <br /> Most vampires choose the former.<br /> <br /> Is Shaitan worse than Ur-Shulgi? Both demand worship and the forsaking of other gods.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> too over the top, typical 2nd ed sabbat with infernalists everywhere, mindlessly violent sabbat, and the weird crossovers </div> </div> </div>I admit, I respect Infernalist Sabbat far more than the alternative. They own their damnation and get something out of it.<br /> <br /> What do you call a Sabbat not on the Path of Evil Revelations?<br /> <br /> &quot;Delusional.&quot;<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Admittedly, my view of the Sabbat is skewed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T11:33:56-07:00","id":1405634,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405620#post1405620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't see why swearing yourself to a being like Shaitan is particularly hard to fathom. If you're a vampire, you're going to encounter beings who give you a choice of immense riches and power or death.<br /> <br /> Most vampires choose the former.<br /> <br /> Is Shaitan worse than Ur-Shulgi? Both demand worship and the forsaking of other gods.</div> </div> </div> </div>the melinda infernalism was only portrayed as a tragedy,<br /> she broke out of her slaver only to end up enslaved to another one<br /> <br /> but it doesn't explain how or why she ended up with Shaitan,<br /> it doesn't explain how or why shaitan is using her,<br /> and it's hard to draw a conclusion yourself, since melinda's regency doesn't differ from the last,<br /> if anything, melinda's regency was a bad deal for shaitan since she allowed the black hand to work unchecked<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Admittedly, my view of the Sabbat is skewed. </div> </div> </div>no, your view of infernalists* is skewed<br /> <br /> in 2e, the infernalists were the &quot;dellusional&quot;, thinking they'd get power yet never got...and most of their masters dealt in souls, meaning they were doubly screwed<br /> <br /> revised fixed that by making sabbat pathetically weak,<br /> so even if you got screwed by your infernal master, you still got a relatively good deal<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T15:37:50-07:00","id":1405679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405585#post1405585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> too over the top, typical 2nd ed sabbat with infernalists everywhere, mindlessly violent sabbat, and the weird crossovers.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, but far from unique in that though yeah, horrible, horrible as a sourcebook, though i do toy with the idea of re-reading it - the kindred related parts at least - and trying a rewrite of sorts for my games.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1405585#post1405585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">the Shaitan thing was never explained,<br /> she was abandoned by helena after helena discovered shaitan and ran away,<br /> she joined the sabbat to break the bond</div> </div> </div> </div>What in itself beggars the question of what Shaitan had <a href=\"https://giphy.com/gifs/starwars-star-wars-episode-3-3o84sq21TxDH6PyYms/fullscreen\" target=\"_blank\">to offer to</a> Melinda after having her blood bond broken, but anyways....<br /> <br /> The Shaitan thing, from what little i remember, is because he slowly brainwashed her through Dominate from torpor, among other things making her believe she was his childe &amp; lover - a very, very bad idea considering her whole relation with Helena, without even going into the Helena's &quot;my sleeper brain mines trump other kindred domination!&quot; power, might be said.<br /> <br /> Must admit i'm not very familiar with her background after Chaos Factor beyond &quot;generic/bland as hell really, woman was doing paint by dots rulership&quot; overall and it looks like you agree with me on that.<br /> <br /> <br /> But anyway, moving to other canon NPCs....<br /> <br /> Bjorn Garinson heard the rumours about <i>Brynhild </i>&amp; the <i>Waelkyrige </i>and his wyrd was certain from that moment on.<br /> Time to go back home.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 07-31-2020, 06:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T19:28:21-07:00","id":1405724,"title":"","content":"I agree about the <i>Mexico by Night </i>regency candidates being more interesting than the BJD ones. The campaign I'd played my elder Tzimisce character in was over by the time of its publication, but I decided he'd favor Charles VI across clan lines over Szechenyi Jol\u00e1n due to the former's alignment with the Ultra-Conservative faction and the Sabbat Inquisition, and the latter's Leftist leanings and freakish obsession with corrupting disfigured children (with Venere Carboni standing for nothing but himself, and thus being beneath contempt).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T20:41:14-07:00","id":1405733,"title":"","content":"Menele is out of torpor and getting caught up on world events by channel surfing. It's not going well.<br /> <br /> &quot;By the Muses! Maury's divinations have determined that Omar *is not* the father!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T19:02:15-08:00","id":1531164,"title":"","content":"Velya asked Vykos how the hell can you take a grafted thing from your insides before they make you totally insane.<br /> Vykos said &quot;Just burn it yo&quot;<br /> <br /> Radu stopped going through canon inertia and thought to himself, 'what the hell I'm doing here? Anarchs hated me with a passion!' and went with Old Clan voivodes.<br /> <br /> Gian Galleazzo is probably the Sabbat number one persona non grata, and constantly lives in fear, but is under Camarilla witness protection.<br /> <br /> Theo Bell, god knows here he is, wakes up every night smiling cuz he shot that smug bastard Hardestadt in the face (ps: I love Hardestadt, mostly cuz I changed many things to make him interesting)<br /> <br /> Carna is expanding her House and thinking she got very freaking lucky escaping the most member-controlling Clan of the most member-controlling sect of vampires, and right after the Prime Chantry got boomed, and Camarilla got knocked out of her feet.<br /> <br /> Goratrix (Tremere) is rubbing his hands evilishly after having Saulot blown to smithereens in Vienna if his plan actually worked.<br /> <br /> Rosemund of Islington got some strange twitch sensation at the end of the Convention of Prague, and shed a tear without knowing why. Than she got called to help arrange the Vermillion Wedding, since she is one of the few Kindred who married, and is now a widow.<br /> <br /> Every Baali in the world came to the realization that Baali Clan is a stupid idea and discovered they are either from different Clans or Caitiffs. Either that or &quot;THE BAALI&quot; never existed, just some isolated or cell-sized infernalist vampires.<br /> And Mary the Black is wondering what she needs to actually &quot;make the underbelly of Istanbul hell on earth&quot;. Michael is getting impatient.<br /> <br /> Baba Yaga woke up with the Beckoning after having a very strange and stupid dream of being killed unceremoniously by a spooky OC vamp child. She managed to hold off the call, but it takes some really strong sorcery for it to work. She sends letters to Louhi, to find out how she is. <br /> <br /> Lugoj Blood-Breaker woke up with the Beckoning, but lied and didn't go back to the Sabbat as he promissed after making the diable-snack. The Eldest is bastard<br /> <br /> Gotson, if the Lasombra fanatic is still alive, is probably going to Gehenna sites to fight demons and infernalists if he finds them. He will probably end there some time.<br /> <br /> If Mithras survived the Fall of London he will probably leave that island forsaken by god and return to Persia to see how things are, maybe he will stop at Rome to see how good old Camila is going. Maybe he will finally have that honey moon with Camdeen he always promissed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Strange... When coincidence seems too convenient, I prefer to call it fate.</i><br /> <br /> <b><sup>-Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain</sup> </b>d=","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25534-banu_saulot","name":"Banu_Saulot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25534_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-20T13:18:04-08:00","id":1531214,"title":"","content":"The only character I thought about was the Gangrel Ramona Tanner-Childe and I picture her that she is still traveling the world telling her clan what happened to cause her clan to leave the Camarilla and that she has gotten way more knowledgable about her society and maybe has picked up a buddy to keep her company.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-22T16:07:46-08:00","id":1531317,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m no familiar enough with the movers and shakers (or the rolling stones and moss-gatherers) of Kindred Society to say much, but I know deep in my soul that whenever \u2018Bela\u2019 is invited to a party he is ALWAYS introduced as \u201cThe real Prince of Los Angeles!\u201d (and, if he\u2019s actually in earshot when that happens, he will always reply \u201cThe Prince of <i>Darkness</i>\u201d).<br /> <br /> Why yes, they absolutely did this while Sebastian LaCroix was still active (Which might explain why \u2018Bela\u2019 seems to have been lying low during the events of BLOODLINES).<br /> <br /> Oh, and if you try telling me that Christopher Houghton would NOT join the swarm of angry Anarchs likely to descend on anyone who damages the \u2018Emperor Norton\u2019 of Cainite society, I must call you a Dirty Little Pile of Secrets!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28339,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","user":"Atticus Cleanclaw","date":".  Failed to make joke at Sebastian LaCroix\u2019s expense 02-22-2024, 07:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-08T00:34:33-07:00","id":1536947,"title":"","content":"Hopefully dead. They were all awful, awful stereotypes, and just plain virtual mannequins.<br /> <br /> Beckett - Constantine, but shittier.<br /> Bell - Angry black man who don't take no shonuff bullshit, but angrier.<br /> Lucita - Edgelord insufferable hot chick, who is suffered because she's hot.<br /> Fatima - Edgelord insufferable hot &quot;Exotic&quot; chick (i.e., black), who is suffered because she's hot.<br /> Anatole - Can see the future, but otherwise a complete non entity.<br /> Dr. Netchurch - Mengele whose delusion makes him think his victims are &quot;volunteers.&quot;<br /> Ruffehazadedude - Supposedly a ubersmart Machiavellian manipulator, but has a undead heart of gold when it comes to his manupulatees?<br /> The Gangrel elder in one of the &quot;Novels&quot; who spent 3 pages explaining to a mortal what &quot;leverage&quot; is when he lifted a piano?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25666-illuminostro","name":"Illuminostro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"166"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-22T03:23:53-07:00","id":1544451,"title":"","content":"I hope they're all dead, because they're all awful 90's stereotypes.<br /> <br /> Beckett - A blatant homage to the Moore character of Constantine. Sarcastic, impudent, disrespectful, but somehow encased in multiple layers of plot armor.<br /> <br /> Lucita - Badass hot chick. Nothing more.<br /> <br /> Fatima - Badass hot chick. Nothing more.<br /> <br /> Anatole - Side plot McGuffin character. &quot;Go here, do this,&quot;<br /> <br /> Hesha - No idea what his purpose is, along with the whole Setitte clan. &quot;Evil, because evil...&quot; OK.... but... but... Hesha treats his slaves well... Yeah, OK.<br /> <br /> I can't remember the others. Tally? Another sarcastic &quot;Evil because evil&quot; character, but the perfect counter to Beckett. How convenient...<br /> <br /> White Wolf created Requiem to solve all the obvious problems of Masquerade. Generation, the stupid meta plot, the stupid elder powers, and the just plain stupidity when WW was pumping out &quot;content&quot; to reap all the money when their property was hot, and was so, so terribly awful. Samuel Haight, the dominatrix unbeatable Black Spiral Female? A 15,000 year old demi-god killed by another demi-god, because &quot;Lol, ya'll ain't shit, watch this.&quot; Like when Stephen King was shithammered drunk and geeked up out of his mind on coke. Yeah, it was that bad.<br /> <br /> The whole Byzantium Triumvirate thing? Remember when they state that millennia old vampires have abandoned all mortal emotions, and desires? But they write metafiction where 3 ancients get jealous over some twinks? Really? Nothing like kingdoms, or empires? Just &quot;You stole my rentboy?&quot;<br /> <br /> But reading through this forum, most posters here act as if the metaplot is a religion, written in stone, from a deity on high.<br /> <br /> This is fiction. You can change anything. literally ANYTHING.<br /> <br /> &quot;What were the personalities of the Antes like? What did Absimiliard like to eat when he was alive? Did he like naps at noon? Did he like rainbows, and playing with meerkats?&quot;<br /> <br /> You know, even though WW got stupid with the metaplot, WW left plenty of room FOR STORYTELLERS TO MAKE UP THEIR OWN MYTHOLOGY. It's stated in the beginning of every splat book. You are LITERALLY EXPECTED TO MAKE YOUR OWN WORLD.<br /> <br /> Do you people not understand that? Guess what, Ventrue isn't dead! He Dominated the whole world to think so! Malkav isn't dead, he retreated into Arcadia, because he was a True Fae who went insane from the the banality of the full potency 2nd generation vampire blood, and let himself be killed to return! There's a Malkavian power to retreat to Arcadia! Haqim is dead, he was diablerized by the demon possessing the body of Ur-Shulgi! The Rock (Dwayne Johnson) is The Stoneman, and his signature discipline is perpetual daywalking! Donald Trump is a 15,000 year old Ante whose signature power is stupidity, combined with delusion! Taylor Swift is the Toreador Antediluvian!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":6},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25666-illuminostro","name":"Illuminostro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"166"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"