d Ante whose signature power is stupidity, combined with delusion! Taylor Swift is the Toreador Antediluvian!</div> </div> </div> </div>ok ok, you don't like World of Darkness metaplot, we get it.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-22T13:12:49-07:00","id":1544490,"title":"","content":"He does like to cause trouble, but it's a given we don't follow metaphor word for word judging by most of the posters here on this forum. Cannon has it uses to create a setting and I mentioned that we don't have the Sabbat in our game and that the 3rd generation don't have much of an active presence in kindred society.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-22T14:27:27-07:00","id":1544502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1544486#post1544486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ok ok, you don't like World of Darkness metaplot, we get it.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can like the Metaplot but not aspects of it. I dont like the signature NPCs, but i largely like the V5 metaplot. Most NPCs in the 'by Night' books i like or see as a template to customize. <br /> <br /> Its not a blanket condemnation of the overall Lore. Otherwise one could use a lore-agnostic setting or something like VtR","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25883-inspectorg","name":"InspectorG","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-23T13:51:36-07:00","id":1544588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>InspectorG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1544502#post1544502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You can like the Metaplot but not aspects of it. I dont like the signature NPCs, but i largely like the V5 metaplot. Most NPCs in the 'by Night' books i like or see as a template to customize.<br /> <br /> Its not a blanket condemnation of the overall Lore. Otherwise one could use a lore-agnostic setting or something like VtR</div> </div> </div> </div>In Illuminstro case, has been banned at least once for inflamatory comments and the lesson wasn't learned as is up to old tricks of just being a edgy troll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-23T13:58:36-07:00","id":1544590,"title":"","content":"Now what do you think is happening to the Cardinal of the Americas Lasombra Elder Franchisco Polina? He has seen his clan more or less join the Camarilla or the Anarchs and he has been a loyal solider and officer of the Sect for most of unlife.<br /> <br /> I don't see him going into hiding or joining the Camariila out of principle and this clan wide defection has probably is a hammer blow to his sense of self.<br /> <br /> On a side note I can totally be fine with Ur-Shugi suffering final death at the hands of the ancient 5th generation Banu Haqim clan mate Issim Ur-Baal who would balk at the idea of taking commands from a child and seeing the Shepard as a what was Haqim thinking when he embraced this person.<br /> <br /> After that I could see Issim Ur Baal directing the clan for own possibly more &quot;sane&quot; plots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 10-23-2024, 05:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-23T16:23:24-07:00","id":1544600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Illuminostro</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1544451#post1544451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You know, even though WW got stupid with the metaplot, WW left plenty of room FOR STORYTELLERS TO MAKE UP THEIR OWN MYTHOLOGY. It's stated in the beginning of every splat book. You are LITERALLY EXPECTED TO MAKE YOUR OWN WORLD.<br /> <br /> Do you people not understand that? Guess what, Ventrue isn't dead! He Dominated the whole world to think so! Malkav isn't dead, he retreated into Arcadia, because he was a True Fae who went insane from the the banality of the full potency 2nd generation vampire blood, and let himself be killed to return! There's a Malkavian power to retreat to Arcadia! Haqim is dead, he was diablerized by the demon possessing the body of Ur-Shulgi! The Rock (Dwayne Johnson) is The Stoneman, and his signature discipline is perpetual daywalking! Donald Trump is a 15,000 year old Ante whose signature power is stupidity, combined with delusion! Taylor Swift is the Toreador Antediluvian!</div> </div> </div> </div>In my headcanon,<br /> <br /> Ventrue is still &quot;alive&quot; carrying out their plans through their clan using their discipline and they don't even know it;<br /> <br /> Lasombra lost her physical body, but before that she formed a council with her seven childer so that they could prepare the clan for Gehenna and what others think is that they diablerized her;<br /> <br /> Malkav went mad after being cursed/blessed with so much knowledge that his Cainite brain would never be able to process, he knows all the possible outcomes and that's why he created the Malkavian clan so that through their actions he could reach the best result for Gehenna. He guides them through the web of madness, not controlling them, but guiding their actions through their neuroses;<br /> <br /> Absimiliard is not the founder of the Nosferatu clan, that was just a mistaken conclusion they reached due to the original progenitor having erased any record of their existence, Absimiliard's true offspring are the Nictuku who are his hunting dogs;<br /> <br /> Tzimice is still alive, or something close to it, parts of his body were scattered to the wind after a fight he had with one of his brothers, but they managed to regenerate and now there are several parts of him scattered around the world and each one contains great power, they are usually in torpor, but when they are awakened they can cause great disasters;<br /> <br /> Cappadocius after having his place usurped had his body divided as a security measure by Augustus Giovanni himself who feared that otherwise he could return, it is not known if this had any effect, but the parts were distributed to elders and some were lost over the years, but only one of them already has enormous power;<br /> <br /> The truth about the Ravnos clan is that it was not created by just one antediluvian, but three, twins who inherited the same curse and the Ravnos clan is actually three clans with similar characteristics.<br /> <br /> And yes, I wrote this just for fun, it has no real use, but it could.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-23T18:28:57-07:00","id":1544616,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1544590#post1544590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now what do you think is happening to the Cardinal of the Americas Lasombra Elder Franchisco Polina? He has seen his clan more or less join the Camarilla or the Anarchs and he has been a loyal solider and officer of the Sect for most of unlife.<br /> <br /> I don't see him going into hiding or joining the Camariila out of principle and this clan wide defection has probably is a hammer blow to his sense of self.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would imagine a loyal servant of the Sabbat like that would have been Beckoned by now. I would imagine he was savvy and powerful enough to not be a sacrifice on the part of the defectors. If the Beckoning isn't your thing, I'd imagine he's figuring out how to flip the more unstable Camarilla cities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6423-higgipedia","name":"higgipedia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6423_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T01:10:41-07:00","id":1544633,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1385358-what-do-you-think-the-canon-npcs-are-up-to?p=1544590#post1544590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now what do you think is happening to the Cardinal of the Americas Lasombra Elder Franchisco Polina? He has seen his clan more or less join the Camarilla or the Anarchs and he has been a loyal solider and officer of the Sect for most of unlife..</div> </div> </div> </div>By his official bio, he have a <b>Nature: </b>Architect and <b>Demeanor: </b>Survivor and quite high (7) on the <b>Path of Power and the Inner Voice </b>witch is about rigorous determination and the amassing of worldly power and through that controlling the Beast<br /> The first &quot;sin&quot; is &quot;Turning down an opportunity for power.&quot; and the thrid is &quot;Not using the most effective tool for control.&quot; , the fourth is &quot;Submitting to the errors of others.&quot; and while the sixth is&quot;Accepting defeat.&quot; - literally succeed, or die - I think Polonia facing the faliure of the Sabbat and its leadership would either stay to try to &quot;repair&quot; the Sabbat but given his nature and demeanor and the Path he is on I think it is more likely he would join the Camarilla like the others and while he saw the Camarilla as a relic of frightened elders who prey upon their childer and cling to dreams of glory that are long gone essentially the Sabbat did the same, just unlike the Camarilla it <i>failed</i><br /> His Clan moved forward and most of the Fiends also quietly retreated from the Sabbat - with 400+ years behind your back (and an Intelligence 5, Wits 6) it is easy to see he jumps ship<br /> At the end of the day the Lasombra are ruthless social climbers, elegant predators and a Darwinian meritocracy and you not survive four century as a Lasombra without staying true to these things<br /> Gian Galeazzo Visconti a former Cardinal did the same just way earlier in Milan and the Lasombra &quot;antitribu&quot; after all came out as &quot;victors&quot; in the Lasombra vs Antitribu conflict<br /> They are firm believers in the worthy ruling and the unworthy serving - and for the <b>Path of Power and the Inner Voice</b> it means you have to succeed even rule in the Camarilla<br /> I wouldn't be suprised if he eventually would ends up an Archon then the Justicar (Montano probably will be the Inner Circle member) of the Clan or given his history, even the <i>Imperator</i>\u200b of the Camarilla","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23890,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","user":"Shadeprowler","date":". 10-24-2024, 08:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T13:09:04-07:00","id":1544673,"title":"","content":"It's possible that Polina has been succumbed to the Beckoning or at the very least is using it to increase his personal power. I never considered him joining the Camarilla but given the edicts of the Path of Power and Inner Voice I could see it happening.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T13:17:57-07:00","id":1544676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Hesha - No idea what his purpose is, along with the whole Setitte clan. &quot;Evil, because evil...&quot; OK.... but... but... Hesha treats his slaves well... Yeah, OK. </div> </div> </div>I take it you didn't read SETITE?<br /> <br /> Pretty much everyone agrees it's the best of the Clan Novels for Hesha's character.<br /> <br /> A deeply unapologetically evil character who doesn't treat his slaves well but has them deeply devoted to him via cult tactics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/